node-telegram-send-title = Send Message
node-telegram-send-description = Send text and inline buttons to Telegram
node-telegram-send-help = Connect In, Chat and Text. Leave the Chat property empty to use its input. For /status replies, wire Command Chat to Chat and Text from template to Text. Reply to keeps the original topic when known; Topic overrides it. Choose keyboard mode: inline, reply, remove or none. Inline buttons: Refresh=status | Open=https://example.org. Reply buttons: plain text, Text=contact or Text=location. Text is limited to 4096 characters. Done and Message are emitted on success; Failed and Error on failure.
